        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add referrerpolicy attribute support to <script>s]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3678</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3678"/>
        <updated>2018-05-30T15:44:44.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9669289?u=af3e22b4d81e37d0a193da5a5149c79d98ec54ed&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This should be about all it takes to add referrer policy support to the <code class="notranslate">&lt;script&gt;</code> element. Should <span class="issue-keyword">close</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="209577639" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/96" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/96/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/96">w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy#96</a>. From what I've seen, all of the script fetching algorithms either rely on each other rely on <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#set-up-the-classic-script-request" rel="nofollow">set up the classic script request</a> or <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#set-up-the-module-script-request" rel="nofollow">set up the module script request</a>, both of which honor the referrer policy that a script fetch options struct carries, so the necessary changes here were pretty local.</p>
<p dir="auto">I can open browser bugs for this and start looking at some tests too, but if someone wants to sanity check the current status of this that'd be great. /cc <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/nyaxt/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/nyaxt">@nyaxt</a> <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/bzbarsky/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/bzbarsky">@bzbarsky</a> (anyone from Safari+Edge?).</p>

<hr>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://whatpr.org/html/3678/indices.html" title="Last updated on May 27, 2018, 4:25 AM GMT (46445ed)" rel="nofollow">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href="https://whatpr.org/html/3678/1b37f96...46445ed/indices.html" title="Last updated on May 27, 2018, 4:25 AM GMT (46445ed)" rel="nofollow">diff</a> )<br>
