        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234957?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This is in connection to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="138245472" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/793" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/issues/793/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/793">#793</a>, to make the discussion a bit more tangible.</p>
<p dir="auto">This is my first time touching the HTML spec and also my first time <em>writing</em> a spec section from scratch. I probably didn’t do everything right, so please be thorough in your review.</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome</li>
<li>Firefox</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <a href="https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt">Tests</a> are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="324417506" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/11069" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/11069/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/11069">web-platform-tests/wpt#11069</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <a href="https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests">Implementation bugs</a> are filed:
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome: <a href="https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1233571" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1233571</a></li>
<li>Firefox: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1722576" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1722576</a></li>
<li>Safari: <a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=228331" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=228331</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">(See <a href="https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes" rel="nofollow">WHATWG Working Mode: Changes</a> for more details.)</p>

